  "intuition": "The static gate failure is because the loss did not declare the required expects keys. Keep the same stable pairwise -logsigmoid margin objective, but add explicit expects for 'log_prob_w' and 'log_prob_l'. Also add lightweight numerical stabilization by centering the margin per-batch (reduces overflow risk when log-probs have large common offsets) and clamping the scaled margin before logsigmoid. Weighting remains elementwise with safe broadcasting and mean reduction to a scalar.",
